# SK-MAP-UNITS -- W7-09-05: the default skirmish map (hillbtwn.map) places its
# own Neutral objects (77 vehicles: cars, trucks, a JEEP...) onto the civilian
# house, next to the start forces, and the AI still builds and fields units.
# W7-09-17: the probe reports the rules id (the civilian truck stays TRUCKA).
set render_every 900
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click start
until 120 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 3
log t0
assert country(2) == Civilian @W7-09-05
assert units(2) >= 60 @W7-09-05
assert units(2,CAR) >= 5 @W7-09-05
assert units(2,PTRUCK) >= 5 @W7-09-05
assert units(2,DTRUCK) == 0 @W7-09-17
assert units(0) >= 1 @W7-09-05
assert units(1) >= 1 @W7-09-05
cheat reveal
cheat view_unit CAR
wait 2
shot sk_map_units_car
# The AI is unaffected: it unfolds its base and trains.
until 4500 buildings(1) >= 4 @W7-09-05
log t1
assert units(2) >= 60 @W7-09-05
end
